# Adapted from fitzforge/polestar guides/forever/alliance/05-duskwood.guide
# at 1775eb81e56fc1e127ae869ccec0b7dc8d7092fd, GPL-3.0-only.
# Southern route split and readiness notes by Aurum. This is a local guide,
# not a handoff to the standard pack. Source facts: research/southern-source-map.json.

step Darkshire readiness
  tip From Lakeshire, follow the road back to Three Corners, then take the road into Duskwood and continue to Darkshire. There is no need to return to Stormwind for this handoff. These pickups are available by 20; several enemies are 24-26, so pull carefully or stay with your leveling partner.
  level 20

step Darkshire
  turnin 95161 -- Deliver the Ruins of Lordaeron letter follow-up to Avette Fellwood during this first Darkshire visit.
  getfp "Darkshire" npc 2409
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790
  accept 101 lvl 18
  accept 56 lvl 18
  accept 96139 lvl 18
  accept 164 lvl 17
  accept 165 lvl 17
  accept 163 lvl 17 -- Elaine Carevin also sends you to Jitters at Raven Hill; this unlocks the spider-leg cooking hand-in.
  note Keep six Gooey Spider Legs from the spiders in this loop. These are different from the Small Spider Legs used in Teldrassil.

step Viktori Prism'Antras
  tip Viktori's house stands at the east end of town. Herble Baubbletump sells engineering goods in the house beside it. Keep the Bronze Tube for the next Duskwood chapter. If sold out, check the auction house when the route returns to Stormwind.
  accept 174 lvl 20
  buy 4371 x1 npc 3133

step Tranquil Gardens Cemetery
  tip Skeletal Warriors and Skeletal Mages walk among the graves south-east of Darkshire, below Blind Mary's house. Keep Skeleton Fingers from any skeletons you kill.
  kill 48 quest 56
  kill 203 quest 56
  collect 2378 quest 101

step Darkshire
  turnin 56
  accept 57 lvl 18
  vendor 228 -- Avette Fellwood: sell low-value loot and repair before restocking drinks at the inn.
  vendor 6790 -- Sell low-value loot, repair nearby, and refill affordable Melon Juice. Keep six Gooey Spider Legs until Dusky Crab Cakes is handed in.
  buy 1205 x20 npc 6790 optional

step Watcher Dodds
  tip Follow the road west. Watcher Dodds stands south of it, at the Yorgen Farmstead.
  accept 245 lvl 17

step Raven Hill
  tip Continue west to Raven Hill. The Memory of Valor glows by the ruined house south of the road.
  collect 281046 quest 96139
  turnin 163
  accept 5 lvl 17

step Raven Hill Cemetery, south
  tip Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends walk the cemetery's southern half. Avoid the roaming elite Mor'Ladim.
  kill 202 quest 57
  kill 531 quest 57
  collect 2378 quest 101

step Sven's Camp
  tip Follow the road north-west past the cemetery to Sven's camp on the west edge of the forest. Lars stands beside him.
  turnin 164
  accept 95 lvl 20
  accept 226 lvl 19

step Abercrombie
  tip The hermit's shack stands north-east of Raven Hill Cemetery.
  turnin 165
  accept 148 lvl 20

step Wolves, spiders and ghouls
  tip Rabid Dire Wolves roam around the cemetery and Abercrombie; Starving Dire Wolves roam north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders are east of the cemetery. The cemetery's northern ghouls drop fangs. Pull one enemy at a time.
  kill 565 quest 226
  kill 213 quest 226
  kill 539 quest 245
  collect 1130 quest 101
  collect 1129 quest 101
  collect 2251 npc 539 x6 optional -- Keep up to six Gooey Spider Legs while killing the required Pygmy Venom Web Spiders; do not start a separate farm for a missing leg.

step Watcher Dodds
  tip Follow the road east toward Darkshire.
  turnin 245

step Yorgen Farmstead
  tip The mound of loose dirt is south of the farmhouse, by the old stump.
  turnin 95
  accept 230 lvl 20

