step Blind Mary
  tip Her house is on the hill south-east of Darkshire, above Tranquil Gardens Cemetery.
  turnin 149
  accept 154 lvl 20

step Madame Eva
  turnin 154
  accept 157 lvl 20

step Reach the Stockades pickup level
  tip Stockades pickups require level 22. If still below 22, finish another Deadmines run with your group or fight nearby Duskwood enemies you can kill comfortably. Keep this guide selected; it continues at 22. Keep five quest log slots free for Stockades. Retain Look to the Stars, Wolves at Our Heels, Sven's Camp and Deliver the Thread for the next Duskwood loop.
  level 22

step Darkshire: batch Stalvan with the city journey
  tip At 22, take Crime and Punishment here for Stockades before leaving. Start Stalvan's investigation at Madame Eva and Clerk Daltry. This chapter handles the Moonbrook and Goldshire evidence before the city dungeon; the eastern Elwynn evidence waits until the later Redridge journey.
  accept 377 lvl 22 group 5
  accept 66 lvl 22
  turnin 66
  accept 67 lvl 22

step Moonbrook schoolhouse evidence
  zone Westfall
  tip Fly to Sentinel Hill, then follow the southwest road into Moonbrook. Open the Old Footlocker in the schoolhouse. Beware of the apparition when interacting; clear nearby Defias first. Keep your hearth bound in Darkshire.
  fly "Sentinel Hill"
  turnin 67
  accept 68 lvl 22

step Bring the evidence back to Daltry
  zone Duskwood
  tip Return to Sentinel Hill and fly to Darkshire; this avoids waiting for the hearth used earlier in the chapter. Hand the letter to Clerk Daltry and take the lead for Goldshire before continuing to Stormwind.
  fly "Darkshire"
  turnin 68
  accept 69 lvl 22

step Goldshire: upstairs evidence and supplies
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Follow the northbound road from Darkshire through Elwynn to Goldshire. Speak with Farley, then take the letter from the upstairs chest in the inn. Keep the letter for Caretaker Folsom in Stormwind.
  turnin 69
  accept 70 lvl 22
  collect 910 quest 70.1
  vendor 295 -- Sell and refill affordable drinks during this inn stop.

step Stormwind: the canal evidence
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Continue north to Stormwind. Speak with Caretaker Folsom and inspect his Sealed Crate nearby. Hold the Eastvale follow-up until the later Redridge trip, so this investigation does not add a separate east-Elwynn journey now.
  turnin 70
  accept 72 lvl 22
  turnin 72
  accept 74 lvl 22
